     1283     ) no-error .
     1284   for each thbjattr_thbj-attr :
     1285       if thbjattr_thbj-attr.prop-code = 'outdate':U  then v-outdate  =  thbjattr_thbj-attr.property-value-character .
     1286       if thbjattr_thbj-attr.prop-code = 'outares':U  then v-outares  =  thbjattr_thbj-attr.property-value-character .
